DECL	{"args":[{"name":"x","sort":{"sort":"track"}}],"body":{"cmp":"gt","lhs":{"args":[{"var":"x"}],"measure":"kin_speed"},"rhs":{"param":"speed_floor"}},"contract":"A road user is in motion at the observation: its speed exceeds speed_floor. The floor names only the source's speed resolution, below which a reading counts as no motion; speed (kin.speed) is in m/s. The concept says nothing of the direction of motion relative to the body or to the road, of a manoeuvre, or of who or what controls the motion. Not denoted: a halt held for a duration, travel along a particular carrier, or a road user being driven by a person.","definition":null,"id":"drv.motion.moving","kind":"formula","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"speed_floor","unit":"metre_per_second"}],"residues":[],"supersedes":null}
